OL,3,GNEWSATown calls on Elton John to back
OL,4,Aup his 1974 song
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is trying to recruit Sir
OL,7,FElton John to back its bid to become UK
OL,8,FTown of Culture in 2028.
OL,10,FGrimsby hopes the musical superstar's
OL,11,Fsupport will boost its chances of
OL,12,Fwinning the year-long arts festival
OL,13,Faward.
OL,15,FSir Elton released an album track in
OL,16,F1974 called Grimsby, written by his
OL,17,FLincolnshire-born songwriting partner
OL,18,FBernie Taupin.
OL,20,FThe lyrics mention "a thousand delights
OL,21,Fcouldn't match the sweet sights of my
OL,22,FGrimsby".
